{"reviews":[{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-0","r":5.0,"t":"Real, old-school essences","x":"Really good smell, the real deal essences, like I remember from the late 90's and early 2000's, not some mock substitute crap. Scent is not overbearing. I have bought a nag champa lotion of a DIFFERENT brand before, and even a dab of it was enough to give me a headache. This stuff is just right.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-1","r":5.0,"t":"Another GREAT scent","x":"love nag champa! now tinted with patchouli.  what memories this brings back.  I now have a different scent every day of the week.  I will stay well stocked.  I guess my ego loves the compliments, especially my wife's.  This company has the best customer service. I wouldn't think of another supplier.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-2","r":5.0,"t":"Nag Chouli","x":"I always mix my nag champa and patchouli together and when I found nag chouli I flipped out! It\u2019s perfect and I\u2019m really happy!!! If you like both of these scents buy this!!!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-3","r":5.0,"t":"lasting scent","x":"This is a spot-on nag champa/patchouli fragrance and also long lasting.  Purchased the rollon which is a good value, a little goes a long way.  Has a sharp scent when first applied and then mellows out as the day goes on.  Really happy with the company and purchase.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-4","r":5.0,"t":"Best combination ever! I cant stop buying this","x":"This stuff is A-mazing! I am constantly getting compliments, my grandmother also fell in love with it I now get the big bottle to keep us stocked up! Such a wonderful mix of two great  earthy scents. I have loads of body spray but this is always the first thing I reach for, long lasting even when I'm dancing the day away at a festival!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"Smells so comforting; the perfect blend of Nag Champa and Patchouli. It's rich with powdery, incense notes blended with earthy, dark patchouli. It has great sillage and projection. The longevity is great as well.  Top tier body oil/fragrance for those who love incense-y, earthy scents.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best scent","x":"I adopted this as my scent about 2 years ago. It turns heads. When I'm just out and about someone always  says someone smells really good. And it's me. It's such a sexy smell. I love patchouli.  I get compliments on it, I've even offered it to people if the want a little on their wrists. It lasts me all day. My sweaters smell like it. I will keep buying it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-7","r":4.0,"t":"Just like the 90's","x":"Smells just like the stuff I wore in high school in the 90s and bright back nostalgic memories. Some cons: scent doesn't last long it lasted about 2 hrs Needs a tad more nag champa But the powder of the champa is more prevalent when the power of patchouli wears down. Overall I love it, a little pricey though, the $8-10 range would be better.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-8","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"I smell like a head shop on Venice Beach and I love it!! This stuff smells so good and you only need a little bit of the oil to last all day. Will definitely purchase this again, I need back ups!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-9","r":5.0,"t":"Smells yummy","x":"This is one of my signature fragrances - several people have ordered it based on how much they liked it when I wore it. I absolutely love  this and will continue to purchase  it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-10","r":5.0,"t":"I love this scent! Like stepping back to the 60s latex fur and feathers wow!","x":"This stuff smells powdery and beautiful like cocoa, mixed with an incredible full bodied aroma similar to nag champa but without the smoke of a traditional incense.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-11","r":5.0,"t":"THIS IS A GREAT PRODUCT","x":"I love this product. Have been looking for it for a long time. Now here it is. Hallelujah!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-12","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful scented blend","x":"I thought this blend was fantastic & have gotten many compliments on how good I smell. Two of my favorite scents mixed into one. I just wish the scent lasted a little longer & that the patchouli was a hint stronger. If you like to wear patchouli and want to change it up a little this is what you want. I would highly recommend nagchouli.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-13","r":5.0,"t":"Smells super good.","x":"I love this. It smells so good! It\u2019s strong so you only need a little bit but it will last a long time. My husband wears it too so it\u2019s unisex for sure. I even put it on cotton swabs and placed them around my house. It\u2019s not too oily either. Dries up on my skin and doesn\u2019t stain clothes.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-14","r":5.0,"t":"So many compliments!!","x":"I wore this to work tonight and received so many compliments!  Everyone loved it and wanted to know what it was and where I got it.  I love the scent and it lasts.  Definitely buying again !","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-15","r":5.0,"t":"People always ask me What are you Wearing?  Smells wonderful.","x":"Old fashioned and wonderful woodsy scent. People ask 'What is that great smell that you have on? I'll never tell, but in a minute or two, I tell them...","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-16","r":5.0,"t":"Very satisfied","x":"I'm a returning customer and I absolutely love this scent, it's not over powering and lasts longer than most I've tried in the past","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-17","r":5.0,"t":"Found my forever scent","x":"I\u2019ve worn Nag for 15 plus years. I\u2019ve worn patchouli for 20 plus years. This prefect combo is just divine. Perfection! Thank you!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-18","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome, and potent.","x":"If you like Nag Champa, and patchouli give it a try. I fell in love with the moment I twisted off the cap. Very potent.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-19","r":5.0,"t":"Smells AWESOME!!!","x":"I love this!!! Two people walked by me and said \"You smell so good\"!!! I will be buying again!!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-20","r":4.0,"t":"Scent on Point","x":"Great smelling product and the scent lasts all day without reapplying. Definitely recommend!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-21","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome smell","x":"I love this smell! It smells like a hippie store and the Ren fest all n one!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love, love, love","x":"Oh my, the scent is a perfect combination of my two favs. I love it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-23","r":4.0,"t":"Best of both worlds.","x":"I love patchouli and Nag Champa. This has a blend of both!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B076XZ3W2B-24","r":3.0,"t":"Not enough patchouli","x":"A lot of nag champa but not enough patchouli.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the scent as a perfect blend of nag champa and patchouli, with many loving the combination.","cites":[2,3,4,5,6,13]},{"text":"Many reviewers report receiving compliments on how good they smell when wearing it.","cites":[2,5,7,10,13,15]},{"text":"A common theme is that the scent is long lasting, though a few reviewers note it fades faster than they'd like.","cites":[4,5,6,8,9,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the scent brings back nostalgic memories of the 90s or earlier.","cites":[1,2,8,11]},{"text":"Reviewers note that only a little product is needed and it is good value.","cites":[4,8,9,14]}]},"qa":[]}